{"availability":"available","full":"Esma326817/HINT","name":"HINT","description":"Unlock long-horizon robot manipulation with HINT, a human-intent inception framework enabling intuitive task planning and execution.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-25T15:02:39Z","updated":"2026-10-10T07:49:03Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://esma326817.github.io","topics":["bem","best-practices","click","hint","interpreter","java","json-schema","performance","purecss","pwa","python310","python311","python312","security","security-scanner","tooltip-library","ui","webhint"],"demo":"https://esma326817.github.io/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.570Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.570Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.570Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.570Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["HINT (Human-Intent Inception) is a smart software system that helps robots understand what you want them to do—even when the task is long and complicated. Think of it as a translator between human wishes and robot actions.","Instead of programming every tiny movement, HINT lets you describe what you want in a natural way, and the robot figures out the steps to get there. This makes robots much more helpful for real-world jobs like picking up objects, organizing spaces, or completing multi-step chores."],"features":["HINT goes beyond simple commands. It understands the purpose behind your request. If you say \"put the cup next to the plate,\" HINT knows you want the cup placed there, even if the robot needs to move obstacles to do it.","Most robot software struggles with tasks that have many steps. HINT is designed for \"long-horizon\" tasks—jobs that require dozens of small actions to complete one big goal.","HINT connects to standard robot hardware and provides clear instructions that the robot can follow. It bridges the gap between human thinking and machine execution.","The software shows you what the robot is \"thinking\" at each step. You can see the plan, monitor progress, and understand why the robot makes certain choices.","You don't need to be a tech wizard. The installation process is straightforward, and the interface is designed to be friendly for everyday users."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Esma326817/HINT/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"30d563d2fcac4e35ae4789bd4e94bdec076f8dabbe32cee8172051b25187e511","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.833Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.833Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"HINT (Human-Intent Inception) is a smart software system that helps robots understand what you want them to do—even when the task is long and complicated. Think of it as a translator between human wishes and robot actions.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Esma326817/HINT/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Most robot software struggles with tasks that have many steps. HINT is designed for \"long-horizon\" tasks—jobs that require dozens of small actions to complete one big goal.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Esma326817/HINT/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"30d563d2fcac4e35ae4789bd4e94bdec076f8dabbe32cee8172051b25187e511","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Esma326817/HINT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.833Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T07:49:03Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Esma326817/HINT/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.834Z","hash":"30d563d2fcac4e35ae4789bd4e94bdec076f8dabbe32cee8172051b25187e511","originalBytes":7618,"storedBytes":7618,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["hint","robot","download","what","robotics","software","computer","robots","see","step","task","want","installation","simulator","tasks","any","click","control","even","find","page","plan","programming","